n')\\\\n  );\\\\n-- Similar policies for news_events and storage bucket.\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n4. Environment Vars (.env.local)  \\\\n``` \\\\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<PROJECT>.supabase.co\\\\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<SUPABASE_ANON_KEY>\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n5. Implement Auth & RBAC in Next.js  \\\\n   • Create supabaseClient.ts.  \\\\n   • Wrap root layout with SessionContextProvider.  \\\\n   • Use useUser() hook to guard pages; 302 redirect guests trying to access protected routes.\\\\n\\\\n6. Build Admin Portal (/admin)  \\\\n   • Only role='admin' can access.  \\\\n   • CRUD UI built with React-Table & react-hook-form connected to Supabase.\\\\n\\\\n7. Contact Form (Edge Function)  \\\\n```bash\\\\nvercel functions add contact-email\\\\n# within api/contact.ts send e-mail via Resend (free 100/day).\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n8. Vercel Deployment  \\\\n```bash\\\\nvercel login\\\\nvercel link --project dunbaroakshoa\\\\nvercel env add NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL ...\\\\nvercel env add NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY ...\\\\nvercel --prod\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n9. Custom Domain  \\\\n   • Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Domains → “dunbaroakshoa.com”.  \\\\n   • Update DNS at registrar to Vercel’s A & CNAME records (deterministic values shown by Vercel).  \\\\n   • HTTPS auto-provisioned.\\\\n\\\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\n6. Security Best Practices Implemented\\\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\n• HTTPS enforced by Vercel.  \\\\n• Supabase RLS policies (principle of least privilege).  \\\\n• JWT in http-only cookies via @supabase/auth-helpers-nextjs—mitigates XSS token theft.  \\\\n• CSP headers and rate-limiting via Vercel middleware (@vercel/edge – 100 req/min per IP).  \\\\n• Secrets stored in Vercel Environments, NOT in repo.  \\\\n• Regular backups: Supabase nightly (free).  \\\\n• Form anti-spam via hCaptcha (free).\\\\n\\\\n----------------------------------------------------------------